    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d818">

                <pb facs="0816" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg558"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2162</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Denmark</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Egan</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-28T17:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 28, 1915, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 8.10 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>174. I am credibly informed that through secret methods British destruction of
                    German submarine boats shows remarkable progress. Evident German alarm.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Minister</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
